    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "π∗(1) =2 π∗(ta1) =β1π∗(ta1−1) − β2π∗(ta1−2) for a ≥ 2 π∗(t1) =β1 + γ π∗(ta1tb2) =β2min(a,b)π∗(t|1a−b|),"
  } ]
